<!-- $title = Services - Enslain Metal Merch-->
<!-- $metaDescription = With Enslain Metal Merch behind the merchandise table, you can leave the displaying, counting, accounting, and selling to us, while you do what you do. -->
<!-- $servicesAriaCurrent = aria-current="page"-->
<!-- $og-img = /assets/img/theme/og/services.jpg -->
<!-- @include "partials/_header.kit" -->
<main class="main">
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section topflow">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="text-container">
            <h1>What we do</h1>
            <p>We love selling merch, and we’re damn good at it. With Enslain Metal Merch behind the merchandise table, you can leave the displaying, counting, accounting, and selling to us, while you do what you do. We bring order to the disorder.</p>
            <p>We do what we do with professionalism and experience. But above all, we’re also fans of live music, and you’ll see this from our passion and dedication to doing quality work for the artists, and providing friendly, relatable service to the fans. Because we also ARE the fans!</p>
          </div>
          <div class="img-container img-container--framed"><img src="/assets/img/content/event-imgs/kalmah-lutakko-table.jpg" alt="Kalmah's, Mors Subita's, and Suotana's t-shirts, hats, patches, CDs and vinyls neatly displayed on a table."></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section" id="services-for-bands">
      <div class="wrapper--narrow">
        <div class="subsection text-container">
          <h2>For bands</h2>
          <p>We work with bands of all sizes, in cities across Finland, to help take away the burden of self-vending, and make sure to create an organized and attention-catching display for the fans to browse. When possible, we try to provide a local seller for gigs, to avoid travel and accommodation costs, but we’re also willing to travel if you’re looking for a dedicated merch seller to join your crew!</p>
          <p>When it comes to tours, we like to work with the artists from the very beginning, helping with planning the item selection and ordering the goods, selling and re-stocking the merchandise, and coordinating inventory and accounting. Some of us also have the required visas/passports to work in North America.</p>
          <p>A few of the bands we regularly work with: Kalmah, Battle Beast, Marko Hietala, Shade Empire, Brymir, Kaunis Kuolematon, Circus of Rock, MyGrain, And Oceans, Mors Subita, Crimson Sun, Arion.</p>
          <p>Ready to enjoy your gig days without having to think about merch? That’s our thing, let us do the heavy lifting!</p>
          <p><a href="/contact/" class="button">Contact us</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="subsection img-container img-container--framed img-container--banner">
          <img src="/assets/img/content/event-imgs/chrissy-with-kalmah.jpg" alt="The bands Kalmah, Mors Subita, and Suotana, plus their support crew are standing on the stage at Jyväskylä's Tanssisali Lutakko venue. A black bucket with a Kalmah logo is hanging on a microphone stand, front and center." loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section" id="services-for-promoters">
      <div class="wrapper--narrow">
        <div class="text-container">
          <h2>For promoters</h2>
          <p>We’ve been selling festival merch since 2017, and we handle the merchandise management, coordination, staffing, sales, card processing, inventory, and accounting. Most of our crew speaks both Finnish and English, and we have our own POS system and card readers as well as supplies for display and accounting. We’re also flexible, and ready to adapt to your event. Note that although we are specialized in heavy metal events, we are also available for others.</p>
          <p>Some of the event and festival clients we’ve worked with: Dark River Festival, Saarihelvetti, North of Hell, Metal Capital, Steelfest, SteelChaos, Tuhdimmat Tahdit, Hellsinki Metal Horizons, Finnish Death Metal Maniacs, Hellsinki Industrial Festival, Master Events, NEM Agency, Elektrik Products</p>
          <p>Looking for an affordable and adaptable crew to take care of your festival’s merch tent? Want to improve your event’s merch experience with a crew that loves what they do, and does it well? Let us send you an offer with more details!</p>
          <p><a href="/contact/" class="button">Contact us</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="img-container img-container--framed img-container--banner"><img src="/assets/img/content/event-imgs/metal-capital-banner.jpg" alt="Chrissy, Miikka, Amy and Janetta enthusiastically flashing the horns in a large merchandise tent at the Metal Capital festival." loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
<!-- @include "partials/_footer.kit" -->
